	<content contentuid="h66324a6egcb26g4e73g888agf10405f9d922" version="1">Second Wind</content>
	<content contentuid="h2dbe6929g0877g414bgb961g4475430b5234" version="1">You regain one &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;Bonus Action&lt;/LSTag&gt; when you gain &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_CELESTIAL_HASTE"&gt;Haste&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Can trigger &lt;b&gt;once per turn&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h589a1f71gc534g4b1fgad0dg63a50d1597b8" version="1">Instantly swap places with target creature in combat. If the target fails an &lt;b&gt;Intelligence&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;([1])&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;you&lt;/b&gt; gain &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_CELESTIAL_HASTE"&gt;Haste&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn without becoming Lethargic afterwards.</content>
